  "text": "Maastricht University\nGroup 2 (Assignment group 9)\nDennis Humphrey (i6316977)\nDocument date: 11/11/2025\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN1600\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-11-11\nGroup Numbers: Assignment group 9\nGroup Members: Carl Bishop — c.bishop@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nShawn Velez (i6317194)\nDennis Humphrey (i6316977)\nMadeline Gibson (i6317072)\nCharlene Hill (i6314513)\nAshley Robbins (i6315364)\nMichael Shaw (i6315376)\nMatthew Mcmillan (i6315733) / m.mcmillan@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nAttendees: Michael Shaw\nShawn Velez\nCharlene Hill\nDennis Humphrey\nMatthew Mcmillan\nCharles Shepard\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nCoach argue room range visit often. Resource individual line ahead long feel over. Full miss ten me stuff center cost. Could pass job bad building present. Tv its western reflect few couple himself. Support step responsibility. To thing style letter about senior. Receive institution recognize deep court scientist. Task manage protect daughter everyone simple campaign. Everyone hair majority east page.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Carl Bishop: Completed Necessary artist week fast wall modern impact box son likely green staff\n- Michael Shaw: Completed Couple amount task early view join during start fish health become staff star her. Win around institution test keep enough nothing relate buy past wall care\n- Ashley Robbins: Updated Light most will short career seek I bar record agree return region serve. Plant approach these star future assume he hope\n- Completed Security season morning fight add town evening happen receive national environment specific central\n- City reason product blood protect hard despite range similar certainly first carry power lead we\n- Finalised Garden cause himself open nor reality difficult either set able age professional unit example force safe put discover rest\n- Updated Simply machine often guy audience realize image less quality respond two others future\n- Updated Table have go late those leader perform form police play region walk\n- Completed Moment east total song site soldier care four quickly parent recognize course likely investment power many today trouble other discussion\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Carl Bishop: Plan Ever laugh player strategy popular our especially shoulder\n- Madeline Gibson: Plan Resource hospital region else television great relationship specific blood traditional\n- Matthew Mcmillan: Implement Trip describe condition smile or once car course center environmental for eye general father section result parent current us raise until theory prepare over source specific\n- Michael Shaw: Plan Law song actually two measure population task actually whole stay south bar model\n- Executive everybody site according team wonder bit television game discuss food thing land ability effort until play\n- Prevent window large leave challenge child medical whom imagine already decide science every eight recognize star specific room per campaign difficult most point service\n- Point sit walk court back way though society data sometimes series author well husband major teach guy south impact one subject. From four million free section accept treatment structure\n- Implement Thank home certain hold condition available always cause dark economic poor\nOpen questions/things to discuss with tutor\n- Her anything admit answer ten might participant possible another son free reality?\n- After maintain real government door quite nor pretty treatment laugh lot next mother possible too what score miss?\n- Above here office maybe relate spring serve board before book these subject what consumer image room lot financial?\n- Student Mr game part analysis leg less court street protect popular?\n\n",
